              "id": "steps-html",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section-heading section-heading--center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">A CLEARER WAY FORWARD</p><h2>How StaffExchangeHub Works</h2></div><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><span>01</span><h3>Create Your Free Profile</h3><p>Register and add your profession, current workplace and location.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><span>02</span><h3>Post Your Swap Request</h3><p>Share where you are, where you want to move and what flexibility you have.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><span>03</span><h3>Discover Potential Matches</h3><p>Compare compatible listings and identify reciprocal exchange opportunities.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><span>04</span><h3>Connect and Discuss</h3><p>Express interest, chat securely and confirm whether both parties are interested.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><span>05</span><h3>Arrange Your Exchange</h3><p>Follow employer or institution approval procedures before finalising any move.</p></div></div><div class=\"cta-strip\"><p>Transfers still require approval from the relevant employer or institution.</p><a class=\"button button--primary\" href=\"/register/\">Create Free Account</a></div>"
